@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description

state "只有常规值" as Ordinary
state "临时覆盖层生效\n（常规值保留在下层）" as Overlay
state "已恢复原值" as Returned
state "被常规事件取代" as Superseded
state "恢复以故障发出告终" as Fault

[*] --> Ordinary
Ordinary --> Overlay : temporary 事件\n（生命周期 Run 或 Until）
Overlay --> Returned : 取消 / Until 过期 /\nendRun 或新的运行（Run）
Overlay --> Superseded : 针对受影响目标的\nordinary 事件
Overlay --> Fault : 恢复时发出故障\n（绝不标记为成功）
Returned --> Ordinary
Superseded --> Ordinary
Fault --> Ordinary
@enduml
